  "lines": [
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "n": "01",
      "text": "Right now, two hundred and six bones are holding you together.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l01.wav",
      "start": 0.7,
      "dur": 3.627
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "n": "02",
      "text": "And most of the time, you never even notice them.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l02.wav",
      "start": 4.627,
      "dur": 3.051
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "n": "03",
      "text": "But bones aren't dry, dead sticks. They're living tissue.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l03.wav",
      "start": 8.478,
      "dur": 3.541
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "n": "04",
      "text": "A hard outer shell of compact bone. A light honeycomb of spongy bone inside.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l04.wav",
      "start": 12.319,
      "dur": 5.376
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "n": "05",
      "text": "And at the core, marrow, making billions of new blood cells every day.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l05.wav",
      "start": 17.995,
      "dur": 4.352
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "n": "06",
      "text": "That design makes bone light, but incredibly tough. It takes several times your body weight with every running stride.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l06.wav",
      "start": 23.147,
      "dur": 7.232
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "n": "07",
      "text": "Bones are also your built-in armour.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l07.wav",
      "start": 31.179,
      "dur": 2.453
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "n": "08",
      "text": "Your skull encases your brain.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l08.wav",
      "start": 33.932,
      "dur": 2.496
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "n": "09",
      "text": "Your ribcage shields your heart and lungs.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l09.wav",
      "start": 36.728,
      "dur": 2.795
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "n": "10",
      "text": "And your spine guards the spinal cord, your body's main information highway.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l10.wav",
      "start": 39.823,
      "dur": 4.736
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "n": "11",
      "text": "Even when a bone breaks, it rebuilds itself, bridging the gap with brand new bone.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l11.wav",
      "start": 45.359,
      "dur": 5.12
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "n": "12",
      "text": "Strong. Light. Alive.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l12.wav",
      "start": 51.279,
      "dur": 1.899
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "n": "13",
      "text": "Your skeleton. Protecting you, every single day.",
      "file": "assets/vo/l13.wav",
      "start": 53.478,
      "dur": 3.179
    }
  ]
}